Run: python3 verify_holdout_degree6.py
Optional complete fixed-denominator tests of the 109 chosen basis columns:
     python3 verify_holdout_degree6.py --scan-basis

Standard-library rational arithmetic only. The variable-D calculation stops
at a necessary quadratic system with 89 unresolved parameters. The optional
scan tests only individual basis denominators, not their combinations.
No degree-six exclusion, certificate, or unrestricted conclusion is claimed.
"""
